   "en": "",
   "term": "null"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen262.0001",
   "jp": "{FFEE}市民を守りながら戦え！{FFF1}",
   "en": "{FFEE}Fight while protecting the citizens!{FFF1}",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen262.0002",
   "jp": "ここで死ぬわけには‥‥",
   "en": "I can't die here...",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen262.0003",
   "jp": "バ、バカな‥‥",
   "en": "I-Impossible...",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen262.0004",
   "jp": "俺の夢もここまでか‥‥",
   "en": "So much for my dreams...",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen262.0005",
   "jp": "だ、だめだ‥‥",
   "en": "I-I can't...",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen262.0006",
   "jp": "死にたくない‥‥",
   "en": "I don't want to die...",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen262.0007",
   "jp": "ああ‥‥守りきれなかった‥‥。",
   "en": "Oh... We couldn't protect them...",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen262.0008",
   "jp": "{v:0049}クックックッ！{n}いつまで無駄な抵抗をするつもりだ？",
   "en": "{v:0049}Heh heh heh! How long do you intend to keep up this{n}futile resistance?",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen262.0009",
   "jp": "{v:004A}ヴェンツェル！？",
   "en": "{v:004A}Wenzel?!",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen262.0010",
   "jp": "{v:004B}おとなしく我が支配を受ければよいものを。",
   "en": "{v:004B}If only you would quietly submit to my rule.",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen262.0011",
   "jp": "{v:004C}誰がアンタなんかの命令を聞くもんですか！",
   "en": "{v:004C}Who'd take orders from the likes of YOU?!",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen262.0012",
   "jp": "‥‥{v:00A2}少しお仕置きが必要だな。{p}{v:004D}ムン！",
   "en": "...{v:00A2}You need a little punishment.{p}{v:004D}Hah!",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen262.0013",
   "jp": "{v:004E}さて、お前たちで、{n}どこまで民間人を守りきれるかな？",
   "en": "{v:004E}Now, let us see how long you can keep these{n}civilians safe.",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen262.0014",
   "jp": "{v:004F}民間人って‥‥俺たちか！？",
   "en": "{v:004F}Civilians... You mean us?!",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen262.0015",
   "jp": "{v:0050}そんな‥ひどい‥‥。",
   "en": "{v:0050}How... How cruel...",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen262.0016",
   "jp": "{v:0052}では、楽しい余興の始まりだ！",
   "en": "{v:0052}Let the entertainment begin!",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  },
  {
   "id": "scen262.0017",
   "jp": "{v:0053}本当は最後まで見てみたいが、私も暇ではないのでね。{n}これで失礼させてもらうよ。",
   "en": "{v:0053}I would dearly like to watch this to the end, but I have{n}other matters to attend to. You will have to{n}excuse me.",
   "term": "end",
   "src": "ps1"
  }
 ]
}
